  "subtitle": "Japanese-inspired crispy fried cheese in dashi broth",
  "excerpt": "Agedashi tofu is a Japanese dish of lightly battered fried tofu served in a savoury dashi broth. This version uses halloumi, which holds its shape under heat and crisps beautifully in a cornflour coating. The broth is made with soy, mirin, and sake.",
